WEBVTT

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.776
AG: Start it.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.856
MB: These conversations that we're having,

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.976
have those conversations
with somebody else.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.816
And then instead of just
letting it be a talk that you had,

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.536
actually decide to start something.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:40.816
OT: That's right.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.555
MB: I mean, that's what you all did.

00:15:42.579 --> 00:15:44.835
You started something,
and look what's happened.

00:15:44.859 --> 00:15:47.776
Thank you all so much
for being here with us today.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.016
OT: Thank you.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.366
(Applause)